flowchart LR
  A[Website inquiry] --> B[Normalize and deduplicate]
  B --> C[Service / urgency / area qualification]
  C --> D[Deterministic estimate]
  D --> E[Human quote approval]
  E --> F{Calendar slot free?}
  F -->|yes| G[Book and confirm]
  F -->|no| H[Choose another slot]
  H --> F
  G --> I[Reminder / job completion / review]
  E --> J[No-response follow-up]
  J --> K[Consent-based reactivation]
